    "description": {
      "en-US": "A powerful native Android app to control your DigitalOcean droplets, domains, managed databases, firewalls, volumes and more...\n\n<h2>Features</h2>\n- Multiple accounts support\n- Theme to blend with your system UI (dynamic colors)\n- Biometric support for security\n- Set your default home screen\n- Change to your native language, if available\n- Dashboard to view all important info\n- Create and view droplets\n- View all events\n- View and create firewalls\n- Manage domains with records\n- Reboot, rebuild, delete, destroy, rename, reset password of droplet and more..\n- Enable and manage droplet backups\n- Manage droplet snapshots\n- View regions, OS images and marketplace apps, plans and sizes\n- View and create VPCs\n- Manage and create your certificates\n- Add and manage your uptime checks\n- View, manage, add, delete managed cluster databases\n- Add and remove users and databases for a database cluster\n- View billing info, invoices and recent history\n- Download invoices as PDF\n- Create and manage your projects\n- and many more...\n\n<p>Complete list of features: https://codeberg.org/swatian/OceanNex/wiki/Features</p>\n<p>Source code: https://codeberg.org/swatian/OceanNex</p>\n<p>Developer: https://mastodon.social/@mmarif</p>\n"
    },
